  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering  Rural Women with Vocational Skills</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia went through 15 years of civil conflict that destroyed lives and displaced the population. An Ebola pandemic hit followed by the Coronavirus.  The economic and social impacts of the pandemic and years of war have deprived rural girls and women of access to cash, health, and a future. The project will provide marketable vocational skills for 150 women and girls to increase their income capacity.  The project will also provide tuition assistance to 180 girls and 20 orphans.</narrative>
  </description>
